cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AmazoniaDB: Independent Public-Interest Directory of Amazon Socioenvironmental Data"
message: "If you use AmazoniaDB to discover, compare, or assemble socioenvironmental sources, please cite the original data providers first and cite AmazoniaDB using this metadata."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "AmazoniaDB"
    website: "https://amazoniadb.org/"
    email: "contato@amazoniadb.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/amazoniadb/website"
url: "https://amazoniadb.org/"
abstract: "A trilingual (Portuguese, English, Spanish), public-interest index of 100 human-reviewed socioenvironmental datasets, geoportals, and monitoring platforms across all nine jurisdictions of the Amazon basin, with explicit access-evidence URLs, technical documentation links, spatial/temporal metadata, responsible-use guidance, and cross-border methodological comparability briefs."
keywords:
  - Amazonia
  - socioenvironmental data
  - remote sensing
  - deforestation monitoring
  - Indigenous territories
  - biodiversity
  - hydrology
  - open data directory
license: MIT
version: "1.12.0"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
